---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="找不到頁面" description="找不到你要瀏覽的VELORIA頁面。">
  <section class="section not-found">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">404</p>
      <h1>這個頁面暫時沒有對應內容。</h1>
      <p>舊站部分會員、購物車與搜尋路由不會移入品牌型新站，請回首頁或直接聯絡我們。</p>
      <a class="button" href="/">回到首頁</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    min-height: 62vh;
    display: grid;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .not-found p {
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .not-found .button {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
